  "design": {
    "idea": "Mini-boss octagonal root-bowl for The Stag Colossus: bloom center thorn-walls in its Timber Charge path to flip it onto its back, or trigger P2 corner Dew Lenses to overheat it, then claim the Sap-Horn and drop north onto the r2 balcony.",
    "kind": "boss",
    "beat": "sho",
    "teaches": "Turning light-grown thorn walls into offensive charge-breakers against Stag Colossus and earning the Sap-Horn dungeon power.",
    "decisions": 6,
    "expert_s": 88,
    "reward": "sap_horn+cycle_1_drop",
    "why": "Dungeon A mini-boss awarding the Sap-Horn and opening Cycle 1 back to Acorn Atrium.",
